## Pixel-art icons in the 16 VGA colors, each drawn at 16 x 16 and at
## 32 x 32 (the detailed art, used for big icons and on 2x screens),
## usable anywhere text is: `label pxFolder & " Documents"`,
## `toolButton(pxCopy, "Copy")`, a tree node, a tab. Original designs in
## the manner of early-1990s desktops. Generated by tools/genicons.py --
## edit that, not this. Each constant is a character of the kit's own
## (Unicode's private area) that text drawing shows as the icon, at the
## text's size.
##
## ```nim
## label pxFolder & " Documents"
## if toolButton(pxCopy, "Copy"): echo "copied"
## ```

